#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:234
msgid "Pronoun Management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:236
msgid ""
"**Minimize pronouns** (\"this,\" \"it,\" \"these,\" \"that\"). When "
"pronouns are necessary, use them as adjectives with a noun:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:238
msgid ""
"**Weak**: \"This shows that the model converges.\" **Strong**: \"This "
"result shows that the model converges.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:241
msgid ""
"**Weak**: \"It improves performance.\" **Strong**: \"This modification "
"improves performance.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:244
msgid "Verb Placement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:246
msgid "**Position verbs early** in sentences for better parsing:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:248
msgid ""
"**Weak**: \"The gradient, after being computed and normalized, updates "
"the weights.\" **Strong**: \"The gradient updates the weights after being"
" computed and normalized.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:251
msgid "Apostrophe Unfolding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:253
msgid "Transform possessive constructions for clarity:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:255
msgid "**Original**: \"X's Y\" → **Unfolded**: \"The Y of X\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:257
msgid ""
"**Before**: \"The model's accuracy on the test set\" **After**: \"The "
"accuracy of the model on the test set\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:260
msgid "This isn't always better, but when sentences feel awkward, try unfolding."
msgstr ""

