msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:378
msgid "Design Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:380
msgid ""
"**Figure 1 is crucial**: Often the first thing readers examine after "
"abstract"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:381
msgid ""
"**Self-contained captions**: Reader should understand figure without main"
" text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_writing-guide.md:382
msgid ""
"**No title inside figure**: The caption serves this function "
"(ICML/NeurIPS rule)"
